   <title>Profiling attributes</title>
   <abstract>This chapter introduces DITA profiling attributes as a mechanism for embedding
      conditional metadata that enables audience-, platform-, product-, and environment-specific
      publishing. It demonstrates how a single source can generate multiple tailored outputs by
      selectively including or excluding content based on defined profiling rules.</abstract>
